        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Leni Riefenstahl, Karl Attenberger, Annie Sundberg, Ricki Stern, Naomi Wolf\n- Films: Triumph of the Will, The End of America\n- Topics: Propaganda film, documentary film, film adaptation\n\nFacts:\n- In 1935, Leni Riefenstahl directed, produced, edited, and co-wrote the German propaganda film Triumph of the Will.\n- In 1935, Karl Attenberger worked with Leni Riefenstahl on the propaganda documentary Triumph of the Will.\n- In 2007, Naomi Wolf wrote the book that The End of America was adapted from.\n- In 2008, Annie Sundberg and Ricki Stern directed the documentary film The End of America.",
